{"query":"Narang Vivenda  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://www.thexclusiveproject.com/properties/narang-vivenda-evershine-nagar-malad-west","title":"NARANG VIVENDA EVERSHINE NAGAR MALAD WEST","content":"Narang Vivenda in Evershine Nagar, Malad West, offers a range of amenities to cater to the modern lifestyle of its residents. Some of the amenities available at Narang Vivenda may include:  \n  \nLandscaped Gardens: Beautifully designed green spaces to relax and unwind.  \nSwimming Pool: A pool for residents to enjoy and relax.  \nGymnasium: Fitness facilities for residents to stay active and healthy.  \nChildren's Play Area: Safe and fun play areas for kids.  \nClubhouse: A clubhouse for social gatherings and events.  \nIntercom: Communication system for enhanced security and convenience.  \nPower Backup: Backup power supply to ensure uninterrupted living.  \nLift: Elevators for easy access to different floors.  \nCar Parking: Dedicated parking spaces for residents. [...] ## ABOUT:\n\n## NARANG VIVENDA EVERSHINE NAGAR MALAD WEST\n\nNarang Vivenda is a residential project located in Evershine Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai. Developed by Narang Realty, Vivenda offers modern apartments with luxurious amenities. The project is designed to provide a comfortable and convenient lifestyle for residents, with features like landscaped gardens, a gymnasium, swimming pool, and play area for children. The location is well-connected to major areas of Mumbai, making it a desirable place to live for those looking for a blend of urban convenience and suburban tranquility.\n\n## AMENITIES:\n\n### NARANG VIVENDA EVERSHINE NAGAR MALAD WEST\n\n\\Artist Images\n\n## AMENITIES LIST:\n\n#### NARANG VIVENDA EVERSHINE NAGAR MALAD WEST [...] The locational advantages of Narang Vivenda in Evershine Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, include:  \n  \nConnectivity: Evershine Nagar is well-connected to major areas of Mumbai through the Western Express Highway and Link Road, ensuring easy commuting to work or other parts of the city.  \nProximity to Essential Amenities: The area is close to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, supermarkets, and restaurants, providing residents with easy access to essential services and entertainment options.  \nPeaceful Environment: Evershine Nagar is known for its peaceful and green surroundings, offering a serene environment for residents to relax and rejuvenate.  \nSafety and Security: The locality is considered safe, with good security measures in place, providing residents with peace of mind.","score":0.8896154,"raw_content":null,"id":"82a199-00"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/narang-vivenda-facilities-evershine-nagar-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r425821","title":"Narang Vivenda Amenities/Specification","content":"Living at Narang Vivenda will come with a planned amenity mix such as swimming pool, gym and children's play area. All amenities are designed for resident-wide","score":0.8737439,"raw_content":null,"id":"24565e-01"},{"url":"https://newprojectsonline.com/narang-vivenda-malad-west-mumbai","title":"Narang Vivenda Malad West | Premium 2/3 BHK Apartments…","content":"Ans: Narang Vivenda integrates a comprehensive suite of 25+ amenities including 24*7 Water Supply, 24/7 Security, Air Conditioned Gym. These","score":0.8576849,"raw_content":null,"id":"98c9ed-02"},{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/NarangRealtyMumbai/videos/every-apartment-at-narang-vivenda-is-optimized-for-spacious-living-ensuring-you-/490221100069191","title":"Every apartment at Narang Vivenda is optimized for spacious living ...","content":"Key amenities showcased include a grand double-height living space, a high-end swimming pool on the 21st floor, and premium community amenities","score":0.8173562,"raw_content":null,"id":"61bb85-03"},{"url":"https://narangvivenda-maladwest.in","title":"Narang Vivenda Malad West | Buy 2, 3 & 4 BHK @ Ushma Nagar","content":"Narang Vivenda Malad West is a Proj